<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Run the straight race through God’s good grace,</l><l>Lift up thine eyes, and seek His face;</l><l>Life with its way before us lies,</l><l>Christ is the path, and Christ the prize.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Cast care aside, lean on thy Guide;</l><l>His boundless mercy will provide;</l><l>Trust, and thy trusting soul shall prove</l><l>Christ is its life, and Christ its love.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Faint not nor fear, His arms are near,</l><l>He changeth not, and thou art dear;</l><l>Only believe, and thou shalt see</l><l>That Christ is all in all to thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
